---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

{/* The one primary action below 64rem, on Today and the Library (D52), where making an episode is
     the next thing to do. On an episode or an older briefing hearing it is, so PlayFab.astro takes
     this place with the same shape and motion, and steps aside while the bar holds that audio
     (BaseLayout.astro has the rule). Extended, the plus and the word, at the top of a page and while
     scrolling back up; folded to the plus while scrolling down to read (scripts/fabScroll.ts). A link
     to /create, so it works without script; the shell turns it into the sheet. From 64rem the side
     column carries the same action, and this one is not shown. It carries a word, so a press shows
     in its fill, never by scaling it. */}
<a class="create-fab" href="/create" aria-label="Catch up" data-create-open data-sound="open">
  <Icon name="plus" class="icon-lg" />
  <span class="create-fab-label" aria-hidden="true">Catch up</span>
</a>
